sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Citizen as Citizen (User Side - U-08)
    actor Recycler as Recycler (Recycler Side - R-05)
    participant Ctrl as NegotiationChatController
    participant PropVal as SendProposalRequestValidator
    participant Svc as NegotiationChatService
    participant Notifier as SignalRNegotiationChatNotifier
    participant Hub as NegotiationChatHub
    participant DB as ApplicationDbContext (PostgreSQL)

    Note over Citizen, DB: 1. Citizen (U-08) gửi Đề xuất giá / khối lượng / khung giờ thu gom đầu tiên (BR-NEG-02, BR-NEG-04)
    Citizen->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/trade/orders/{orderId}/proposals (SendProposalRequest)
    Ctrl->>PropVal: ValidateAsync(request)
    alt Đơn giá <= 0, khối lượng <= 0 hoặc thiếu ProposedTimeSlot
        PropVal-->>Ctrl: IsValid = false
        Ctrl-->>Citizen: 400 Bad Request (MSG-GEN-01)
    else Đề xuất đầu vào hợp lệ
        PropVal-->>Ctrl: IsValid = true
        Ctrl->>Svc: SendProposalAsync(orderId, citizenUserId, "Citizen", request)
        Svc->>DB: Query TradeOrder (Include User, RecyclerProfile)
        alt TradeOrder.Status KHÔNG phải Pending hoặc Negotiating (VD: đã Accepted - BR-NEG-02)
            Svc-->>Ctrl: Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-NEG-02", "MSG-NEG-PROPOSAL-LOCKED")
            Ctrl-->>Citizen: 400 Bad Request (Tính năng đề xuất đã khóa sau khi chốt đơn)
        else TradeOrder đang Pending hoặc Negotiating
            Svc->>DB: Chuyển TradeOrder.Status: Pending -> Negotiating (BR-HND-02)
            Svc->>DB: Cập nhật TradeOrder.ProposedTimeSlot = request.ProposedTimeSlot (BR-NEG-04)
            Svc->>DB: Insert ChatMessage #1 (Type = Proposal, ProposalStatus = Pending, ProposalData = jsonb)
            Svc->>DB: SaveChangesAsync()
            Svc-->>Ctrl: (ProposalDto #1, SupersededIds = [], Toast = MSG-NEG-01, Notification = MSG-NEG-02)
            Ctrl->>Notifier: NotifyProposalCreatedAsync(orderId, ProposalDto #1, [], MSG-NEG-02)
            Notifier->>Hub: Broadcast "ProposalCreated" to Group "order:{orderId}"
            Hub-->>Recycler: Real-time Event ProposalCreated (#1 Pending) + MSG-NEG-02
            Ctrl-->>Citizen: 201 Created ApiResponse<ChatMessageDto> (MSG-NEG-01)
        end
    end

    Note over Recycler, DB: 2. Recycler (R-05) gửi Phản đề xuất (Counter-Proposal) điều chỉnh khung giờ/giá -> Ghi đè đề xuất cũ (BR-NEG-03)
    Recycler->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/trade/orders/{orderId}/proposals (Counter SendProposalRequest)
    Ctrl->>PropVal: ValidateAsync(counterRequest)
    PropVal-->>Ctrl: IsValid = true
    Ctrl->>Svc: SendProposalAsync(orderId, recyclerUserId, "Recycler", counterRequest)
    Svc->>DB: Query ChatMessages (TradeOrderId == orderId && Type == Proposal && ProposalStatus == Pending)
    DB-->>Svc: [ChatMessage #1]
    Svc->>DB: Đánh dấu ChatMessage #1: ProposalStatus = Superseded (BR-NEG-03: Chỉ đề xuất mới nhất có hiệu lực)
    Svc->>DB: Insert ChatMessage #2 (Type = Proposal, ProposalStatus = Pending, SenderRole = "Recycler")
    Svc->>DB: SaveChangesAsync() (Atomic Transaction)
    Svc-->>Ctrl: (ProposalDto #2, SupersededIds = [Message#1.Id], Toast, MSG-NEG-02)
    Ctrl->>Notifier: NotifyProposalCreatedAsync(orderId, ProposalDto #2, [Message#1.Id], MSG-NEG-02)
    Notifier->>Hub: Broadcast "ProposalCreated" (NewProposal #2 + SupersededIds) to Group "order:{orderId}"
    Hub-->>Citizen: Real-time Event ProposalCreated (Làm mờ #1 Superseded, hiển thị nút Accept trên #2)
    Ctrl-->>Recycler: 201 Created ApiResponse<ChatMessageDto>

